      "effect": "Pick an enemy unit, other than a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit, hit by at least one of those attacks. Whenever it makes a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move), [Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or [Fall Back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) before [your next Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), roll a D6 for each of its models; it takes a [mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) for each 1, up to 6 per move."
